From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:53:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 20/59] kernelbase: Launcher compatibility (CEF arguments, Epic
 GPU setting, unchanged-refcount module lookup).

From WineForge/MetalSharp: Steam, Rockstar Social Club, EA, Battle.net and Ubisoft CEF
command-line additions, Epic BaseWindowsEngine.ini CEF GPU acceleration off, and
GetModuleHandleEx unchanged-refcount lookup through LdrGetDllHandle (Diablo II: Resurrected).

(cherry picked from commit d03c2d3fc8c4f6fbd8c6e5f1fecaf60f9c9a0eb7)
